<title>BELARUS: Belarus rouble slipped down to 19,100 per dlr in M.</title>
<headline>Belarus rouble slipped down to 19,100 per dlr in M.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belarussian rouble edged down to 19,100 per dollar on the Minsk Interbank Currency Exchange from 18,600 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    January 16	  January 15</p>
<p> Rate to dollar		    19,100		18,600</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $2.763 million	  $13.192 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
